      "summary": ": Wednesday 29/07 We are open today with another nice day ahead! Temperatures are mild with northerly winds and mostly cloudy skies. Another excellent night of grooming has the maunga looking great. Conditions on trail are superb. Snow conditions off-piste are variable with some great snow up high in shaded areas. Wednesday 29/07 We are open today with another nice day ahead! Temperatures are mild with northerly winds and mostly cloudy skies. Another excellent night of grooming has the maunga looking great. Conditions on trail are superb. Snow conditions off-piste are variable with some great snow up high in shaded areas. Main Basin and Valley lifts will be open from 8:30am Captains, T-Bar, Soho and Willows to follow. Willows is off-piste only so recommending advanced riders only. Main Basin and Valley lifts will be open from 8:30am Captains, T-Bar, Soho and Willows to follow. Willows is off-piste only so recommending advanced riders only.",
